**Status:** ACTIONABLE - Extract to shared helper function
**Recommendation:** Create a utility function in a new module (e.g., `crates/fuse/src/crypto_helpers.rs`):
```rust
pub fn wrap_ipns_key_for_tee(
    ipns_private_key: &[u8],
    tee_public_key: Option<&[u8]>,
) -> Result<Option<String>, String> {
    if let Some(tee_key) = tee_public_key {
        let wrapped = cipherbox_crypto::wrap_key(ipns_private_key, tee_key)
            .map_err(|e| format!("TEE key wrapping failed: {}", e))?;
        Ok(Some(hex::encode(&wrapped)))
    } else {
        Ok(None)
    }
}
```

Replace all 4 call sites with this single function. Note: Windows location D uses `ecies::wrap_key` but the macOS version doesn't prefix the module - verify they're the same function.

